# Keep the Docker build context lean and predictable.
#
# This file is at the repository root on purpose. docker-compose.yml builds
# with the REPOSITORY ROOT as the context (`context: ..`,
# `dockerfile: .devcontainer/Dockerfile`), and docker reads
# `<context>/.dockerignore` — so a `.dockerignore` next to the Dockerfile is
# never read by this build. Without a root file every rebuild ships the whole
# checkout to the daemon, including node_modules and any dataset files fetched
# locally.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
.pi
*.log
